            </svg>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <!-- Review text -->
        <p
          style="
            margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #a3a3a3;
          "
        >&ldquo;Le velour tracksuit est parfait. La coupe, la texture, le poids du tissu &mdash; tout est juste.
        Delivery was fast to Paris. This brand understands what premium really means.&rdquo;</p>

        <!-- Gold divider -->
        <div style="height: 1px; background-color: #C9A84C; opacity: 0.25; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;"></div>

        <!-- Reviewer -->
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Arial Black', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 900; color: #e5e5e5;">Chris T.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #737373;">Paris, FR</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 4px;">
            <span
              style="
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                font-size: 0.6875rem;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.05em;
                color: #22c55e;
                background-color: rgba(34,197,94,0.1);
                padding: 2px 8px;
                border-radius: 9999px;
              "
            >&#10003; Verified</span>
            <span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.6875rem; color: #737373;">Velour Tracksuit Set</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {%- comment -%}--- Review 3 ---{%- endcomment -%}
      <article
        style="
          background-color: #0d0d0d;
          border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
          border-radius: 2px;
          padding: 24px;
          transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
        "
        onmouseenter="this.style.borderColor='rgba(201,168,76,0.20)'"
        onmouseleave="this.style.borderColor='#1a1a1a'"
      >
        <!-- Stars -->
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="#C9A84C" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/>
            </svg>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <!-- Review text -->
        <p
          style="
            margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #a3a3a3;
          "
        >&ldquo;Wore the Platinum Edition Tee to a set and got asked where it was from at least a dozen times.
        The weight is different from anything on the market. Proper 00s energy, no shortcuts.&rdquo;</p>

        <!-- Gold divider -->
        <div style="height: 1px; background-color: #C9A84C; opacity: 0.25; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;"></div>

        <!-- Reviewer -->
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Arial Black', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 900; color: #e5e5e5;">Marcus L.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #737373;">Amsterdam, NL</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 4px;">
            <span
              style="
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                font-size: 0.6875rem;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.05em;
                color: #22c55e;
                background-color: rgba(34,197,94,0.1);
                padding: 2px 8px;
                border-radius: 9999px;
              "
            >&#10003; Verified</span>
            <span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.6875rem; color: #737373;">Platinum Edition Tee</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .testimonials-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Testimonials",
  "limit": 1,
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Testimonials"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
